            <article class="py-6"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">What is Valid.guide?</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Valid.guide is an independent validation service for courses, guides, workshops, programs and other online learning products. It provides a structured assessment and a public trust record where publication is appropriate.</p></article>
